<p>By proceeding, I agree to the <a href="/content/nationalgallerysg/sg/en/terms-and-conditions" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Terms and Conditions</a>, <a href="/content/nationalgallerysg/sg/en/terms-of-use" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Terms of Use</a> and <a href="/content/nationalgallerysg/sg/en/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

                                     </span>
                                   </label><small class="input-invalid">Please acknowledge that you have read the terms and conditions, and the privacy policy.</small>
                                </div>
                                <div class="container__form-content-action">
                                  <button class="btn btn-primary" aria-label="Subscribe" :disabled="!isFormValid" type="submit">
